# A "triggers only once each turn" ability in a loop of mandatory actions that ends the loop, because each time round it is a
# new object's (CR 400.7). Bot2 Entombs its own Worldgorger Dragon on turn 2; Bot1 casts Raven of Fell Omens ("Whenever you
# commit a crime, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life. This ability triggers only once each turn.") on turn 3 and
# Necromancy on turn 5. Necromancy's enters ability targets the Dragon in Bot2's graveyard, the only creature card in a
# graveyard - a crime (CR 700.13: targeting a card in an opponent's graveyard) - and the Raven's ability triggers, the only
# trigger then, and drains. The Dragon, Bot1's, exiles Necromancy, the Raven and Bot1's Swamps; Necromancy's leaves ability
# sacrifices it, to Bot2's graveyard; its leaves ability returns them all, new objects. Necromancy's enters ability targets
# the Dragon again, its only choice, another crime - and the Raven that sees it is another object than the one whose ability
# triggered before, with no triggering of its own this turn (CR 400.7: a permanent that leaves and returns is a new object
# with no memory of its previous existence), so it triggers and drains again. Every round is forced and comes back to the same board
# with Bot2 a life lower and Bot1 a life higher: after twenty rounds Bot2 is at 0 and loses (CR 704.5a), Bot1 at 40. Were
# the limit counted for the card rather than for the object, the Raven would drain once and the loop would be a draw.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Raven of Fell Omens
Necromancy
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Worldgorger Dragon
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot2.Search(Worldgorger Dragon)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Raven of Fell Omens.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
? Bot2.Graveyard = Entomb; Worldgorger Dragon
Bot1.Hand.Necromancy.Cast

[Expect]
Result = Bot1 won
Bot2.Status = Lost
Bot2.Life = 0
Bot1.Life = 40
Turn = 5
Step = Main1
